# frozen_string_literal: true

# Bead ita-census, target side: the internal class-object call
# `Ghost.nm` is the residue — and, before the stand-down, every host
# whose return-type evaluation walked THIS body emitted a second,
# foreign-span copy of it. `Ghost` exists so the receiver is a real
# project class and the miss lands in the NotFound arm.
class Ghost; end

module M
  def self.outer(x)
    Ghost.nm(x)
  end
end
